    <string name="terms_title">Words used in this app</string>
    <string name="terms_body">Ringer = the sound / vibrate / mute switch of the phone (what is called “silent mode” in English).\nDND = Do Not Disturb (what is called “サイレントモード” in Japanese).\nTo avoid mix-ups this app only says “Ringer” and “DND”.\nA profile is one combination of the two.</string>

